{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/80802-how-would-you-build-a-vampire-hunter-of-true-faith","id":80802,"title":"How would you build a vampire hunter of true faith?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-26T22:10:26-08:00","id":80802,"title":"How would you build a vampire hunter of true faith?","content":"How would you build a mortal vampire hunter that has unshakable faith in god?<br /> <br /> I know a true believer is extremely rare but how would you build yours and how can it be built?<br /> <br /> if you have or have in mind a concept or something story related feel free to post it too!<br /> <br /> you coul tell why would he have such faith in god and hatred for the kindred for example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2331-rallen12","name":"Rallen12","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T00:25:25-08:00","id":80859,"title":"","content":"There's a Protestant Compact and a Catholic Conspiracy in the Core-book based directly on religious devotion. Malleus Maleficarum has Endowments for performing Holy Miracle (including the traditional repel the undead with holy symbol power). If you get the &quot;Compacts &amp; Conspiracies&quot; pdf, the Long Night has an Endowment (a 1-5 point merit) for Prayer, to represent their well-spring of willpower that comes from their faith.<br /> <br /> If you want to apply these powers to other religions they should be very easy to reskin (Prayer more easily than Benedictions, but far from impossible with Benedictions).<br /> <br /> <br /> Other than that - it all comes down to roleplaying really. I don't know what you mean by how you &quot;build&quot; a true faith driven character. Invest in a great deal of Resolve and Willpower, and roleplay them as driven by their faith!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T08:33:50-08:00","id":81060,"title":"","content":"As I recall there are some rules for using a version of True Faith in the Mirrors book.<br /> <br /> -Slag","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}